, "relax", "mindfulness", "TRIPP"], "long_description": "# Drift into a world of pure sensory relaxation with SensiSpark\nStep into a world of relaxation with a VR experience crafted to calm the mind and engage the senses. Explore tranquil environments, create soothing visuals, and interact with serene elements that help you unwind and find peace.\n\n{1659489498100905}\n\nSlow down and immerse yourself in a stress-free moment of serene gameplay.\n\n{731289859249555}\n\nLight up the night sky with floating lanterns\u2014relax, release, and feel the calm take over.\n\n{1849948609128646}\n\nA calming celebration in the sky\u2014set off fireworks and enjoy the beauty in every burst.\n\n{1703512913602425}\n\nGlide through a glowing world of neon particles\u2014relax, flow, and feel the rhythm of light.\n\n{1782134385988136}", "short_description": "Drift into a world of pure sensory relaxation with SensiSpark \u2014 a calming VR experience designed to soothe your senses and ease your mind. Explore peaceful, sensory-rich environments where gentle sounds, soft colors, and mindful interactions help you relax, de-stress, and restore balance. Whether you're watching waves, painting with light, or floating through the clouds, SensiSpark invites you to unwind and reconnect with calm."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.idzdigital.com/privacypolicy-vr.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": " IDZ Digital Private Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://idzdigital.com/vr-games.php", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_gr